---
/**
 * Multi-head attention lesson — illustration #1.
 *
 * The dimension flow: one input embedding (d_model) splits into h
 * parallel heads each at d_k = d_model/h, each runs attention
 * independently, outputs concatenate back to d_model, then a final
 * W_O projection. Uses 12 heads with d_model = 768 as the running
 * example (matching the lesson body).
 */
---

<figure class="cw-illus">
	<svg viewBox="0 0 800 380" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-labelledby="mh-flow-title mh-flow-desc">
		<title id="mh-flow-title">Multi-head attention dimension flow</title>
		<desc id="mh-flow-desc">A vertical flow diagram. At the top, one box represents the input embedding at dimension 768. An arrow splits downward into many parallel heads. The middle row shows three example heads (head 1, head 2, head 12) each with their own query, key, value projection at dimension 64, plus an ellipsis indicating the others. Each head runs attention independently and produces its own 64-dimensional output. Below, all 12 head outputs concatenate back into one 768-dimensional vector. Finally, an output projection W sub O produces the layer's 768-dimensional output.</desc>

		<defs>
			<marker id="cw-arrow-mh" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" orient="auto">
				<path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="currentColor"/>
			</marker>
			<marker id="cw-arrow-mh-accent" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" orient="auto">
				<path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="#7c3aed"/>
			</marker>
		</defs>

		<rect x="320" y="20" width="160" height="44" rx="6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
		<text x="400" y="42" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="currentColor">input embedding</text>
		<text x="400" y="58" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, monospace" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.7">d_model = 768</text>

		<line x1="400" y1="64" x2="120" y2="100" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.5"/>
		<line x1="400" y1="64" x2="280" y2="100" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.5"/>
		<line x1="400" y1="64" x2="520" y2="100" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.5"/>
		<line x1="400" y1="64" x2="680" y2="100" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.5"/>

		<rect x="60" y="100" width="120" height="120" rx="6" fill="none" stroke="#7c3aed" stroke-width="1.5"/>
		<text x="120" y="120" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="12" font-weight="600" fill="#7c3aed">head 1</text>
		<text x="120" y="142" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, monospace" font-size="10" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.65">Q, K, V</text>
		<text x="120" y="158" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, monospace" font-size="10" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.65">each d_k = 64</text>
		<text x="120" y="183" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.7" font-style="italic">attention</text>
		<text x="120" y="207" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, monospace" font-size="10" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.65">out: 64</text>

		<rect x="220" y="100" width="120" height="120" rx="6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
		<text x="280" y="120" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="12" font-weight="600" fill="currentColor">head 2</text>
		<text x="280" y="142" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, monospace" font-size="10" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.65">Q, K, V</text>
		<text x="280" y="158" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, monospace" font-size="10" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.65">each d_k = 64</text>
		<text x="280" y="183" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.7" font-style="italic">attention</text>
		<text x="280" y="207" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, monospace" font-size="10" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.65">out: 64</text>

		<text x="400" y="160" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="20" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.5">…</text>
		<text x="400" y="178" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.5">heads 3 to 11</text>

		<rect x="460" y="100" width="120" height="120" rx="6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
		<text x="520" y="120" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="12" font-weight="600" fill="currentColor">head 12</text>
		<text x="520" y="142" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, monospace" font-size="10" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.65">Q, K, V</text>
		<text x="520" y="158" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, monospace" font-size="10" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.65">each d_k = 64</text>
		<text x="520" y="183" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.7" font-style="italic">attention</text>
		<text x="520" y="207" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, monospace" font-size="10" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.65">out: 64</text>

		<rect x="620" y="100" width="120" height="120" rx="6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="3 3" opacity="0.55"/>
		<text x="680" y="120" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.55" font-style="italic">each head</text>
		<text x="680" y="138" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.55" font-style="italic">has its own</text>
		<text x="680" y="156" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.55" font-style="italic">trained W_Q,</text>
		<text x="680" y="174" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.55" font-style="italic">W_K, W_V</text>

		<line x1="120" y1="220" x2="380" y2="252" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.5"/>
		<line x1="280" y1="220" x2="395" y2="252" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.5"/>
		<line x1="520" y1="220" x2="410" y2="252" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.5"/>

		<rect x="280" y="252" width="240" height="44" rx="6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
		<text x="400" y="274" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="currentColor">concatenate 12 outputs</text>
		<text x="400" y="290" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, monospace" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.7">12 × 64 = 768</text>

		<line x1="400" y1="296" x2="400" y2="318" stroke="#7c3aed" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#cw-arrow-mh-accent)"/>
		<text x="412" y="312" text-anchor="start" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="#7c3aed" font-style="italic">× W_O</text>

		<rect x="280" y="320" width="240" height="44" rx="6" fill="none" stroke="#7c3aed" stroke-width="2"/>
		<text x="400" y="342" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="#7c3aed" font-weight="600">layer output</text>
		<text x="400" y="358" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, monospace" font-size="11" fill="#7c3aed" opacity="0.85">d_model = 768</text>
	</svg>
	<figcaption>Multi-head attention with 12 heads at <code>d_model = 768</code>. The input splits into 12 parallel attention computations, each on its own 64-dim slice; outputs concatenate back to 768; one more linear projection produces the layer's output.</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
	.cw-illus { margin: 1.75rem auto; max-width: 100%; }
	.cw-illus svg { display: block; width: 100%; max-width: 780px; height: auto; margin: 0 auto; }
	.cw-illus figcaption { text-align: center; font-size: 0.85rem; opacity: 0.75; margin-top: 0.5rem; font-style: italic; }
	.cw-illus figcaption code { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, monospace; font-size: 0.85em; }
</style>
